.SH "NAME"
pkgctl-db-move \- Move packages between binary repositories.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.sp
pkgctl db move [OPTIONS] [SOURCE_REPO] [TARGET_REPO] [PKGBASE]...
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.sp
Move packages between binary repositories i.e. from \fIextra\-testing\fP to \fIextra\fP.
